  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Skinning a Searing Whelp always yields a skin (#10191)",
  "contract": [
    "Requires CoALegendaryItems.DropChance=0: only the skinning table is under test.",
    "Skinning loot 4324 listed five GroupId 0 rows rolled independently and summing to 100 percent, so about 27 percent of skins came back empty. As one GroupId 1 group with the same chances it always yields exactly one item. The scenario kills, loots and skins 8 Searing Whelp (entry 4324), looting the ordinary corpse loot first because a corpse is skinnable only once that is gone. The harness caps a scenario at eight creatures, so a broken table passes by chance about 8 percent of the time; the fixed table can never fail."
  ],
